Hi {Owner},

I build websites for swim schools around {City}. {Business Name} has happy swimmers on its social pages, but no site where a parent can check session dates and join the waitlist.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a skills checklist for each swim level, a session calendar, a pool and changing room guide and an online waitlist, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and session updates. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone between lesson blocks?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
